# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in the keys you have:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# scripts/benchmark.py and examples/server.py load .env automatically.
# Variables already set in your shell take precedence over this file.
# Leave a line commented out rather than empty: an empty ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
# would shadow credentials from `ant auth login`.

# Jev (TypeSafe AI). Used with `benchmark.py --live-jev`, or by the gate when
# policy/paved_gate.policy.yaml sets evaluator.mode: live
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY=

# Google Gemini Decision 1 (Decisions API). Used when a policy or a CLI flag selects
# provider gemini_decision in live mode. Needs the gemini extra: uv sync --extra gemini
# Free tier content may be used by Google to improve its products; send only public or synthetic data.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# OpenAI: GPT-4o zero-shot benchmark arm
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Anthropic: Claude zero-shot benchmark arm, and the demo server's frontier handler
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Only if your key is not scoped to a workspace (the API returns a 400 asking for
# the anthropic-workspace-id header). Find the ID under Console > Settings > Workspaces.
# ANTHROPIC_WORKSPACE_ID=
